      "content": "It sounds like you're feeling utterly overwhelmed by the sheer weight of existence itself, and that feeling of wanting to surrender is terrifyingly strong. That sense of the universe folding in on you is a profound darkness, but even in these heavy moments, your presence matters. Please consider talking to someone who can listen without judgment, like a helpline, to share this immense pressure.",
